msgid "LCD Shield"
msgstr "LCD Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/lcd-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The LCD Shield is a 1.8 inch 128x160 SPI TFT for showing live frames or "
"debugging information directly from the OpenMV Cam. Ideal for field robotics"
" and stand-alone deployments."
msgstr ""
"L'LCD Shield è un TFT SPI da 1.8 pollici 128x160 per mostrare frame in tempo"
" reale o informazioni di debug direttamente dall'OpenMV Cam. Ideale per la "
"robotica sul campo e i deployment autonomi."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/lcd-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `LCD Shield product page "
"<https://openmv.io/products/lcd-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Per il datasheet completo, le foto e gli ordini consulta la `pagina prodotto"
" dell'LCD Shield <https://openmv.io/products/lcd-shield>`_\\ ."

